The legal text comes from the PDF "Constitución de la República de Honduras, actualizada noviembre 2021" published by the Organization of American States (https://www.oas.org/ext/Portals/33/adam/Content/RsU8CsGIXU29uci6sllzCw/Text/ConstituciondelaRepublica(actualizadanoviembre2021).pdf), retrieved on 29 October 2026. No licence is stated. The Constitution is an official legal text; its copyright status is not confirmed here, and it is reproduced with the attribution above.

The Código Penal (La Gaceta No. 34,940) and the Código del Trabajo (CEDIJ edition) come from the website of the Tribunal Superior de Cuentas (tsc.gob.hn); no licence is stated, and they are reproduced as official legal texts with that attribution.

The Código Procesal Penal and the Código Civil are the editions of the Centro Electrónico de Documentación e Información Judicial (CEDIJ) of the Poder Judicial de Honduras (poderjudicial.gob.hn); no licence is stated, and they are reproduced as official legal texts with that attribution.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text was converted to one Markdown file per provision, one paragraph per line; spacing, quotes and dashes were normalised; footnotes, running heads and page numbers were removed; and the text was arranged as git commits. The wording of the law was not changed. The Organization of American States does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
